+ * Example usage:
+ * ```
+ * arg_cmd_itr_t itr = arg_cmd_itr_create();
+ * while (arg_cmd_itr_advance(itr)) {
+ *     const char* key = arg_cmd_itr_key(itr);
+ *     printf("Sub-command: %s\n", key);
+ * }
+ * arg_cmd_itr_destroy(itr);
+ * ```
+ *
+ * @param itr The sub-command iterator.
